        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105274?u=173310b843e2751843265438af8cfb79eda02039&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Removes the leftover <code class=\"notranslate\">SVGAElement.text</code> entry from the instance properties list on the <code class=\"notranslate\">SVGAElement</code> interface page.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>The <code class=\"notranslate\">text</code> property was removed from Gecko in Firefox 125 and isn’t implemented anywhere else.</li>\n<li>The page was deleted in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4633895686\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44410\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/44410/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44410\">#44410</a>, and the <code class=\"notranslate\">api.SVGAElement.text</code> BCD entry is gone too.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This was the last remaining reference.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzil.la/1880689\" rel=\"nofollow\">Firefox bug 1880689</a>: Remove <code class=\"notranslate\">SVGAElement.text</code></li>\n<li>Removed from the SVG 2 spec: <a href=\"https://svgwg.org/svg2-draft/linking.html#InterfaceSVGAElement\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">SVGAElement</code> interface</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Relates to <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4633895686\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44410\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/44410/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44410\">#44410</a>.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45624",
            "title": "Remove SVGAElement.text from the interface page",
