        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #41604.\">Fix</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3532560050\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41604\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41604/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41604\">#41604</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">There's no need not to use ESM. It offers top-level await, avoiding some very weird coding patterns. All documentation offers code examples in the ESM version.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Also removed Luxon, but not sure about modernizing the other dependencies. If agreed, they could be a follow-up tasks.</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5405756758\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/express-locallibrary-tutorial/issues/369\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/express-locallibrary-tutorial/pull/369/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/express-locallibrary-tutorial/pull/369\">mdn/express-locallibrary-tutorial#369</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45596",
