        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286386?u=bc4894b945491e0834d2306dade7fef748ddf698&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Added <code class=\"notranslate\">named-features()</code> function to the <code class=\"notranslate\">@supports</code> at-rule page</li>\n<li>Added the following <em>named features</em> to the <code class=\"notranslate\">named-features()</code> section:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">anchor-position-follows-transforms</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">single-axis-scroll-container</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Working on <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45431\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/45431/hovercard\">MDN Issue #45431</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45429\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/45429/hovercard\">MDN Issue #45429</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30464\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30464/hovercard\">BCD PR</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45357\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45357/hovercard\">Firefox Release PR</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45593",
            "title": "added the named-features function and features to @supports at-rule",
            "date_modified": "2026-09-10T15:30:16.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-09-09T15:43:06.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "dletorey",
